+# DADAO port (skeleton placeholder)
+
+Placeholder for the DADAO-v5 port of picolibc.
+
+No behaviour is declared here. The real port (board/machine support, cross file,
+syscall stubs and build integration) belongs to M7 (see DADAO-v5 task
+`INFRA-055t` and the M7 planning task). This file exists only so that the
+component patch tree under `components/picolibc/` is a valid, rebuildable
+skeleton (`spec/Process-01-组件补丁组织与构建编排.md`: one patch per upstream
+file, `patches/` a pure mirror of the upstream tree).
